"Můžeš také poskytnout příkaz ``else`` a použít složitější podmíněnou logiku:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"instruction_durations\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"instruction_durations\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Removal of `Instruction.duration` and `Instruction.unit` {#removal-of-instructionduration-and-instructionunit}"
msgstr "Odstranění `Instruction.duration` a `Instruction.unit` {#removal-of-instructionduration-and-instructionunit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Circuit [`Instruction`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Instruction) objects previously had attributes called `duration` and `unit`.\n"
"These no longer exist in Qiskit v2.0.\n"
"This is because the field generally only duplicated information that was a fixed property of hardware, and was stored explicitly in the [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target).\n"
"Storing the information separately for each individual instruction significantly increased the memory demands of Qiskit and slowed down even circuit operations that did not directly need to touch the information.\n"
msgstr ""
"Objekty Circuit [`Instruction`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Instruction) měly dříve atributy `duration` a `unit`.\n"
"Tyto atributy v Qiskit v2.0 již neexistují.\n"
"Důvodem je, že toto pole obecně pouze duplikovalo informace, které byly pevnou vlastností hardwaru a byly explicitně uloženy v [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target).\n"
"Ukládání informací samostatně pro každou jednotlivou instrukci výrazně zvýšilo paměťové nároky Qisku a zpomalovalo i operace s Circuit, které přímo nepotřebovaly tyto informace.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [`Delay`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#delay) instruction still contains these fields, as does the new-in-v2.0 [`BoxOp`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#box), because these instructions have a _variable_ delay.\n"
msgstr "Instrukce [`Delay`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#delay) stále obsahuje tato pole, stejně jako nový [`BoxOp`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#box) přidaný ve v2.0, protože tyto instrukce mají _proměnné_ zpoždění.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can retrieve the hardware-specified duration of a particular hardware-supported [`Instruction`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Instruction) by querying the [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target).\n"
"To do this, index the [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) first with the operation's name, and then the indices of the hardware qubits as a tuple.\n"
"This will return either `None` (if the instruction is supported, but no specific properties were assigned to it), or an [`InstructionProperties`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.InstructionProperties) instance, from which the [`duration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.InstructionProperties#qiskit.transpiler.InstructionProperties.duration) field may provide the duration in seconds (or `None`, if not supplied).\n"
msgstr ""
"Hardwarově specifikovanou dobu trvání konkrétní hardwarově podporované [`Instruction`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Instruction) můžeš získat dotazem do [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target).\n"
"K tomu indexuj [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) nejprve názvem operace a poté indexy hardwarových Qubitů jako n-tici.\n"
"Tím získáš buď `None` (pokud je instrukce podporována, ale nebyly jí přiřazeny žádné specifické vlastnosti), nebo instanci [`InstructionProperties`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.InstructionProperties), z níž pole [`duration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.InstructionProperties#qiskit.transpiler.InstructionProperties.duration) může poskytnout dobu trvání v sekundách (nebo `None`, pokud není zadána).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In general, as classical control-flow becomes more common within circuit executions, the \"duration\" of a circuit will become less and less well defined.\n"
"While Qiskit v2.x still includes the [`QuantumCircuit.duration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit.duration) attribute, it is recommended to move away from it, as it will likely be removed in the future; the assumptions under which it is valid will be violated more and more frequently.\n"
"Instead, you can use the new [`QuantumCircuit.estimate_duration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit.estimate_duration) method, which is safer and clearer about the necessary assumptions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Obecně platí, že jak se klasické řízení toku stává běžnějším při provádění Circuit, bude \"doba trvání\" Circuit stále méně a méně přesně definována.\n"
"Přestože Qiskit v2.x stále zahrnuje atribut [`QuantumCircuit.duration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit.duration), doporučuje se od něj upustit, protože bude pravděpodobně odstraněn v budoucnosti; předpoklady, za nichž je platný, budou stále častěji porušovány.\n"
"Místo toho můžeš použít novou metodu [`QuantumCircuit.estimate_duration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit.estimate_duration), která je bezpečnější a jasněji definuje nezbytné předpoklady.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"qiskit.transpiler\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"qiskit.transpiler\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "qiskit.transpiler {#qiskittranspiler}"
msgstr "qiskit.transpiler {#qiskittranspiler}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"generate_preset_pass_manager\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"generate_preset_pass_manager\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Changes to `generate_preset_pass_manager` interface {#changes-to-generate-preset-pass-manager-interface}"
msgstr "Změny rozhraní `generate_preset_pass_manager` {#changes-to-generate-preset-pass-manager-interface}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit v2.0.0 includes a series of updates to the preset pass manager interface (that is, the\n"
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) and\n"
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#transpile) functions) that affect the\n"
"handling of loose constraint inputs, such as `coupling_map` or `basis_gates`. The number of\n"
"transpilation use cases where loose constraints are accepted has been reduced in favor of the\n"
"`target` and `backend` inputs (where `backend` is a [`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2) that\n"
"contains a [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) instance),\n"
"which allow for a more expressive communication of these constraints.\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit v2.0.0 obsahuje řadu aktualizací rozhraní předvoleného správce průchodů (tedy funkcí\n"
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) a\n"
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#transpile)), které ovlivňují\n"
"zpracování volných vstupů omezení, jako jsou `coupling_map` nebo `basis_gates`. Počet\n"
"případů použití transpilace, kde jsou volná omezení přijímána, byl omezen ve prospěch vstupů\n"
"`target` a `backend` (kde `backend` je [`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2) obsahující\n"
"instanci [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target)),\n"
"které umožňují výraznější komunikaci těchto omezení.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following examples show the main changes and suggested alternatives for migrating. Note that all\n"
"of the migration tips below apply to both `transpile` and `generate_preset_pass_manager`:\n"
msgstr ""
"Následující příklady ukazují hlavní změny a navrhované alternativy pro migraci. Všimni si, že všechny\n"
"níže uvedené tipy pro migraci se vztahují jak na `transpile`, tak na `generate_preset_pass_manager`:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `backend_properties` input argument is no longer supported, and the `BackendProperties` class has\n"
"been removed. You should use the `target` or `backend` arguments instead to communicate\n"
"gate durations and errors. There are multiple paths for constructing a custom [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target):\n"
msgstr ""
"Vstupní argument `backend_properties` již není podporován a třída `BackendProperties` byla\n"
"odstraněna. Pro komunikaci dob trvání Gate a chyb bys měl/a použít argumenty `target` nebo `backend`.\n"
"Existuje více cest pro vytvoření vlastního [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target):\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  a. Build a target from scratch and add the relevant errors and durations to the corresponding gates:\n"
msgstr "  a. Vytvoř Target od základu a přidej příslušné chyby a doby trvání k odpovídajícím Gate:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler import (\n"
"    Target, InstructionProperties, generate_preset_pass_manager)\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler import (\n"
"    Target, InstructionProperties, generate_preset_pass_manager)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    from qiskit.circuit.library import XGate, CXGate\n"
msgstr "    from qiskit.circuit.library import XGate, CXGate\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    target = Target(num_qubits=2)\n"
"    target.add_instruction(\n"
"    CXGate(), {(0, 1): InstructionProperties(error=.0001, duration=5e-7)})\n"
msgstr ""
"    target = Target(num_qubits=2)\n"
"    target.add_instruction(\n"
"    CXGate(), {(0, 1): InstructionProperties(error=.0001, duration=5e-7)})\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    target.add_instruction(\n"
"        XGate(),\n"
"        {\n"
"            (0,): InstructionProperties(error=.00001, duration=5e-8),\n"
"            (1,): InstructionProperties(error=.00002, duration=6e-8)\n"
"        }\n"
"    )\n"
msgstr ""
"    target.add_instruction(\n"
"        XGate(),\n"
"        {\n"
"            (0,): InstructionProperties(error=.00001, duration=5e-8),\n"
"            (1,): InstructionProperties(error=.00002, duration=6e-8)\n"
"        }\n"
"    )\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    pm = generate_preset_pass_manager(target=target)\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    pm = generate_preset_pass_manager(target=target)\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  b. Use [`GenericBackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.fake_provider.GenericBackendV2) to quickly build a\n"
"     generic target with pre-filled errors and durations. These can also be updated post-construction:\n"
msgstr ""
"  b. Použij [`GenericBackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.fake_provider.GenericBackendV2) pro rychlé vytvoření\n"
"     obecného Target s předvyplněnými chybami a dobami trvání. Ty lze také aktualizovat po vytvoření:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.providers.fake_provider import GenericBackendV2\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler import generate_preset_pass_manager\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.providers.fake_provider import GenericBackendV2\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler import generate_preset_pass_manager\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    target = GenericBackendV2(num_qubits=2, basis_gates=[\"x\", \"cx\"]).target\n"
"    target.update_instruction_properties(\"x\", (0,), InstructionProperties(0.00001))\n"
"    target.update_instruction_properties(\"x\", (1,), InstructionProperties(0.00002))\n"
"    target.update_instruction_properties(\"cx\", (0, 1), InstructionProperties(0.0001))\n"
msgstr ""
"    target = GenericBackendV2(num_qubits=2, basis_gates=[\"x\", \"cx\"]).target\n"
"    target.update_instruction_properties(\"x\", (0,), InstructionProperties(0.00001))\n"
"    target.update_instruction_properties(\"x\", (1,), InstructionProperties(0.00002))\n"
"    target.update_instruction_properties(\"cx\", (0, 1), InstructionProperties(0.0001))\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"2. The `instruction_durations` and `timing_constraints` input arguments are no longer supported. You should use the\n"
"  `target` or `backend` arguments instead. The alternatives are constructing a custom [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) from\n"
"  scratch, constructing a generic backend, and, in addition to these, it is possible to build a custom target with\n"
"  `instruction_durations` and/or `timing_constraints` using the `Target.from_configuration` method:\n"
msgstr ""
"2. Vstupní argumenty `instruction_durations` a `timing_constraints` již nejsou podporovány. Měl/a bys\n"
"  místo nich použít argumenty `target` nebo `backend`. Alternativami jsou vytvoření vlastního [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) od základu,\n"
"  vytvoření obecného Backend a navíc je možné vytvořit vlastní Target s\n"
"  `instruction_durations` a/nebo `timing_constraints` pomocí metody `Target.from_configuration`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler import Target, generate_preset_pass_manager\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler.timing_constraints import TimingConstraints\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler.instruction_durations import InstructionDurations\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler import Target, generate_preset_pass_manager\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler.timing_constraints import TimingConstraints\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler.instruction_durations import InstructionDurations\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    instruction_durations = InstructionDurations(\n"
"      [(\"x\", None, 200), (\"cx\", None, 1000)], dt=1e-7)\n"
msgstr ""
"    instruction_durations = InstructionDurations(\n"
"      [(\"x\", None, 200), (\"cx\", None, 1000)], dt=1e-7)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    timing_constraints = TimingConstraints(\n"
"            granularity=1, min_length=1, pulse_alignment=1, acquire_alignment=1\n"
"        )\n"
msgstr ""
"    timing_constraints = TimingConstraints(\n"
"            granularity=1, min_length=1, pulse_alignment=1, acquire_alignment=1\n"
"        )\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    target = Target.from_configuration(num_qubits=2,\n"
"                                      basis_gates=[\"x\", \"cx\"],\n"
"                                      instruction_durations=instruction_durations,\n"
"                                      timing_constraints=timing_constraints)\n"
msgstr ""
"    target = Target.from_configuration(num_qubits=2,\n"
"                                      basis_gates=[\"x\", \"cx\"],\n"
"                                      instruction_durations=instruction_durations,\n"
"                                      timing_constraints=timing_constraints)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"3. Providing `coupling_map` and/or `basis_gates` along with a `backend` is discouraged, and from\n"
"  v2.0 a `UserWarning` will be raised. In these cases there are multiple sources of truth,\n"
"  and information such as gate errors and durations from the backend cannot be resolved based on the\n"
"  information given.\n"
"  The suggested alternative is to define a custom target that combines the chosen constraints either\n"
"  from scratch, using [`Target.from_configuration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target#from_configuration) or [`GenericBackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.fake_provider.GenericBackendV2).\n"
msgstr ""
"3. Poskytování `coupling_map` a/nebo `basis_gates` spolu s `backend` se nedoporučuje a od\n"
"  v2.0 bude vyvolána `UserWarning`. V těchto případech existuje více zdrojů pravdy a\n"
"  informace jako chyby Gate a doby trvání z Backend nelze vyřešit na základě\n"
"  poskytnutých informací.\n"
"  Navrhovanou alternativou je definovat vlastní Target, který kombinuje zvolená omezení buď\n"
"  od základu, pomocí [`Target.from_configuration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target#from_configuration) nebo [`GenericBackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.fake_provider.GenericBackendV2).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"4. The `basis_gates` argument no longer accepts custom basis gates. The suggested alternative\n"
"  is the `target` argument, which can be built from scratch or through [`Target.from_configuration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target#from_configuration)\n"
"  such as:\n"
msgstr ""
"4. Argument `basis_gates` již nepřijímá vlastní základní Gate. Navrhovanou alternativou\n"
"  je argument `target`, který lze sestavit od základu nebo pomocí [`Target.from_configuration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target#from_configuration),\n"
"  například:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.circuit.library import XGate\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler.target import Target\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.circuit.library import XGate\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler.target import Target\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    basis_gates = [\"my_x\", \"cx\"]\n"
"    custom_name_mapping = {\"my_x\": XGate()}\n"
"    target = Target.from_configuration(\n"
"        basis_gates=basis_gates, num_qubits=2, \n"
"        custom_name_mapping=custom_name_mapping\n"
"    )\n"
"    pm = generate_preset_pass_manager(target=target)\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    basis_gates = [\"my_x\", \"cx\"]\n"
"    custom_name_mapping = {\"my_x\": XGate()}\n"
"    target = Target.from_configuration(\n"
"        basis_gates=basis_gates, num_qubits=2, \n"
"        custom_name_mapping=custom_name_mapping\n"
"    )\n"
"    pm = generate_preset_pass_manager(target=target)\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"5. The input combination where a custom `coupling_map` is provided with either a `backend` or `basis_gates`\n"
"  that contain gates with three or more qubits is no longer allowed. The coupling map\n"
"  does not provide the necessary connectivity details to be able to determine the  action of the gate.\n"
"  In these cases, the recommended migration path is the creation of a custom target from scratch.\n"
msgstr ""
"5. Kombinace vstupů, kde je vlastní `coupling_map` poskytnut spolu s `backend` nebo `basis_gates`\n"
"  obsahujícími Gate se třemi nebo více Qubity, již není povolena. Mapa propojení\n"
"  neposkytuje nezbytné detaily o propojení k určení akce Gate.\n"
"  V těchto případech je doporučenou migrační cestou vytvoření vlastního Target od základu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"6. The `inst_map` argument has been removed without alternative. It was used to provide pulse information\n"
"  to the transpiler, and the full `qiskit.pulse` module has been removed.\n"
msgstr ""
"6. Argument `inst_map` byl odstraněn bez náhrady. Byl používán k poskytování pulsních informací\n"
"  Transpileru a celý modul `qiskit.pulse` byl odstraněn.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"qiskit.pulse\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"qiskit.pulse\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "qiskit.pulse {#qiskitpulse}"
msgstr "qiskit.pulse {#qiskitpulse}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The module `qiskit.pulse` has been completely removed from Qiskit, without replacement.\n"
"This includes the related items:\n"
msgstr ""
"Modul `qiskit.pulse` byl z Qisku zcela odstraněn bez náhrady.\n"
"To zahrnuje související položky:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "the [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit), [`DAGCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.dagcircuit.DAGCircuit) and [`DAGDependency`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.dagcircuit.DAGDependency) property `calibrations`.\n"
msgstr "vlastnost `calibrations` tříd [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit), [`DAGCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.dagcircuit.DAGCircuit) a [`DAGDependency`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.dagcircuit.DAGDependency).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "the [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit) methods `has_calibration_for` and `add_calibration`.\n"
msgstr "metody `has_calibration_for` a `add_calibration` třídy [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "the [`DAGCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.dagcircuit.DAGCircuit) method `has_calibration_for`.\n"
msgstr "metoda `has_calibration_for` třídy [`DAGCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.dagcircuit.DAGCircuit).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "the transpiler passes `PulseGates`, `RXCalibrationBuilder`, `RZXCalibrationBuilder`, `EchoRZXWeylDecomposition`, `ValidatePulseGates`.\n"
msgstr "průchody Transpileru `PulseGates`, `RXCalibrationBuilder`, `RZXCalibrationBuilder`, `EchoRZXWeylDecomposition`, `ValidatePulseGates`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "the module `qiskit.scheduler` and all its contents.\n"
msgstr "modul `qiskit.scheduler` a veškerý jeho obsah.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "the [`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2) methods `instruction_schedule_map`, `drive_channel`, `measure_channel`, `acquire_channel` and `control_channel`.\n"
msgstr "metody `instruction_schedule_map`, `drive_channel`, `measure_channel`, `acquire_channel` a `control_channel` třídy [`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "the [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) methods `has_calibration`, `get_calibration`, `instruction_schedule_map` and `update_from_instruction_schedule_map`.\n"
msgstr "metody `has_calibration`, `get_calibration`, `instruction_schedule_map` a `update_from_instruction_schedule_map` třídy [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "the `inst_map` argument of [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager), [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#transpile), and [`Target.from_configuration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target#qiskit.transpiler.Target.from_configuration).\n"
msgstr "argument `inst_map` funkcí [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager), [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#transpile) a [`Target.from_configuration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target#qiskit.transpiler.Target.from_configuration).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "the `calibration` field of [`InstructionProperties`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.InstructionProperties).\n"
msgstr "pole `calibration` třídy [`InstructionProperties`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.InstructionProperties).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This happened because IBM Quantum&reg; QPUs ceased to offer pulse-level access, and the Qiskit team no longer had resources to maintain the little-used package.\n"
"You can continue to use the `qiskit.pulse` module while using the v1.x series of Qiskit, which has bug-fix support until September 2024 and security support until March 2025, but the module is removed from the v2.x series.\n"
msgstr ""
"K tomu došlo, protože IBM Quantum&reg; QPU přestaly nabízet přístup na úrovni pulsů a tým Qisku již neměl prostředky k údržbě málo používaného balíčku.\n"
"Modul `qiskit.pulse` můžeš nadále používat s řadou v1.x Qisku, která má podporu oprav chyb do září 2024 a bezpečnostní podporu do března 2025, ale modul byl odstraněn z řady v2.x.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Most uses of `qiskit.pulse` can be replaced with direct access to fractional gates on IBM Quantum Heron QPUs (and later generations, if applicable).\n"
"You can read more in [the migration guide for converted pulse usage to fractional gates](/guides/pulse-migration).\n"
msgstr ""
"Většinu použití `qiskit.pulse` lze nahradit přímým přístupem k frakcionálním Gate na IBM Quantum Heron QPU (a novějších generacích, pokud je to relevantní).\n"
"Více si přečteš v [průvodci migrací převedeného pulsního použití na frakcionální Gate](/guides/pulse-migration).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can no longer load QPY files that contain `ScheduleBlock` objects in Qiskit v2.0 because of the removal of Qiskit Pulse.\n"
"You can continue to load these files in the Qiskit v1.x series.\n"
msgstr ""
"Soubory QPY obsahující objekty `ScheduleBlock` již v Qiskit v2.0 nelze načíst z důvodu odstranění Qiskit Pulse.\n"
"Tyto soubory můžeš nadále načítat v řadě Qiskit v1.x.\n"
